Char[] toCharArray()
Converts this String to a new character array.
public class Geeks {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        String str = "Hello";
        char[] chars = str.toCharArray();
        for(char c : chars) {
            System.out.print(c + " ");
        }
    }
}
